        modifiers: [
          "dungeon-core: Relative position works differently for an immobile protagonist whose \"peers\" may be invading adventurers rather than a social cohort; apply the underlying question (has the gap between capability and demand stayed alive?) rather than the literal peer-comparison framing."
        ],
