        modifiers: [
          "dungeon-core: Unusually strong fit — an immobile protagonist has a naturally rich, built-in set of problems that no amount of growing stronger can solve (the core cannot leave, cannot choose its location, cannot un-know what it has learned about its invaders), making this practice especially productive here."
        ],
