      section: "What it can look like on the page",
      content: "- A scene where a new, significant capability is gained, and the narration\n  or a character explicitly notes what it does *not* change about their\n  personal situation.\n- A long-running relationship or regret that remains unresolved across many\n  power-tier increases, without the story ever implying that more strength\n  would have fixed it.\n- The inverse, as a warning sign: a personal or relational problem that\n  quietly disappears from the narrative around the same time the character\n  crosses a major power threshold, with no scene actually resolving it.",
