      section: "Questions for the author",
      content: "- What does this character want that no amount of strength can get them?\n- Is there a problem from early in the manuscript that a reader might now\n  expect to be trivially solvable — and if so, has the story addressed that\n  expectation directly?\n- If you listed every capability this character has gained, would any of\n  them plausibly \"solve\" a relationship, a regret, or a loss the story hasn't\n  actually resolved?\n- Does the power system have any stated hard limits, and do they hold under\n  narrative pressure?",
