      section: "Original micro-examples",
      content: "*Silent absorption (a caution, not a model):* Wren's estrangement from a\nsibling is a live thread through the manuscript's first third. Wren crosses\na major power threshold at the midpoint. The sibling thread is never\nmentioned again, with no scene resolving or acknowledging it.\n\n*Protected negative space:* Wren crosses the same threshold, and the very\nnext scene has Wren specifically think that this new strength changes\nnothing about the sibling's silence — the story keeps that problem visibly\nalive rather than letting it quietly vanish.",
